Illini Subsurface Drain Layout
QGIS plugin: automated subsurface (tile) drainage layout, tile burying and pipe sizing.

The tile burying scheme (core/bury.py) and pipe sizing (core/sizing.py) are
ported from Routines J (Tile Burying System), K (Network Pipe Sizing) and G
(Tile Network Ordering) of the Illini Drainage Tools, Copyright (C) 2022 University of
Illinois, Urbana-Champaign USA (Anamelechi Falasy and Richard Cooke), licensed
under the GNU General Public License v3; see LICENSE_ILLINI_DRAINAGE_TOOLS.txt.

